### Smart Pharmacy API - manual tests
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension, or copy the URLs into Postman.
### Run the requests top to bottom; the @token variables fill themselves from the login responses.

@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### 2. Search - exact name
GET {{base}}/medicines?search=paracetamol

### 3. Search - brand name
GET {{base}}/medicines?search=Dolo

### 4. Search - generic name
GET {{base}}/medicines?search=Acetaminophen

### 5. Search - partial text
GET {{base}}/medicines?search=para

### 6. Search - misspelled (should return matchType "fuzzy")
GET {{base}}/medicines?search=paracetmol

### 7. Search - no match (matchType "none")
GET {{base}}/medicines?search=zzzzzz

### 8. Categories
GET {{base}}/categories

### 9. Nearby pharmacies around T Nagar, Chennai
GET {{base}}/pharmacies/nearby?lat=13.0418&lng=80.2341&distance=10

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### CUSTOMER
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

# @name userLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ravi@example.com", "password": "User@123" }

###
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.token}}

### Current account
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### My reservations
GET {{base}}/reservations/my
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Notifications
GET {{base}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Reserve a medicine
### Replace INVENTORY_ID with an _id from GET /medicines/:id availability list
POST {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "inventoryId": "INVENTORY_ID", "quantity": 2 }

### Role check - a customer must NOT be able to read admin stats (expect 403)
GET {{base}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### PHARMACY
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

# @name pharmacyLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "apollo@pharmacy.com", "password": "Pharma@123" }

###
@pharmacyToken = {{pharmacyLogin.response.body.token}}

### Dashboard stats
GET {{base}}/inventory/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}

### Inventory
GET {{base}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}

### Low stock
GET {{base}}/inventory/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}

### Reservations received
GET {{base}}/reservations/pharmacy
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}

### Update stock and price (replace INVENTORY_ID)
PUT {{base}}/inventory/INVENTORY_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 32.50, "stock": 8 }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### ADMIN
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

# @name adminLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@pharma.com", "password": "Admin@123" }

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### System statistics
GET {{base}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Recent activity
GET {{base}}/admin/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### All customers
GET {{base}}/admin/users?role=user
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### All pharmacies (including blocked ones)
GET {{base}}/pharmacies?all=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### All reservations
GET {{base}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Add a category
POST {{base}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Skin Care", "description": "Dermatology medicines" }

### No token at all - expect 401
GET {{base}}/inventory
